Modifications
-------------
Overdrive Engine is a separate product built on that base. The following files
and areas are modified or added relative to the upstream commit above. This
notice exists to satisfy the requirement in section 4(b) of the Apache License,
Version 2.0, that modified files carry prominent notices stating that they were
changed.

  Project.xml              product identity (title, file name, package name)
  README.md                product README
  source/overdrive/**      all original Overdrive code (new)
  source/states/**          menu and song-selection entry points, as required
  source/backend/**         settings and save extensions, as required
  source/states/editors/ChartingState.hx
                           one additional Song ID control block; the editor is
                           otherwise unchanged from upstream
  assets/overdrive/**      original Overdrive artwork (new)

A complete, machine-checkable list of modified upstream files is the output of:

    git diff --stat 5c67ced49e5a98535298a6daa3f8f4ec79ac8399 <release-commit>

